{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36898","headline":"寄杨秘书 · 罗隐","name":"寄杨秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧檐雪打窗声，因忆江东阮步兵。\n两信海潮书不达，数峰稽岭眼长明。\n梅繁几处垂鞭看，酒好何人倚槛倾。\n会待与君开秫瓮，满船般载镜中行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}